WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.630
Coming from the heavens...

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:47.010
...Axis destroyed the Titans' base,
the Gate of Zedan, with one blow.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.280
However, no one believed this
was enough to destroy...

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.650
...the Titans' aspirations.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:02.120
Scirocco Rises

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.860
Will Jamitov make a move?

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.330
He will.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.100
Because I told him that
I'll be meeting with Haman.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:20.440
Mr. Paptimus!

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.610
Why won't you take me with you?!

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.420
I thought I gave you
the responsibility of guarding the Jupitris!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.580
No! Please leave the negotiations
with Haman to me!

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:37.520
Haman's not someone
that you can handle.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.490
How can you be so sure?

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.360
Sarah.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.370
If it's just to accompany me,
I'll allow it!

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.700
Thank you very much.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:52.670
Sarah.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.700
Sarah!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.780
Mr. Paptimus just doesn't want to
see you overdo things.

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.170
That's not true!

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.340
It's all because you're getting between
me and Mr. Paptimus...!

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:05.390
Sarah!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:08.010
If I had defected from the A.E.U.G....

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:10.060
...then I could've been
his advisor as well!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:15.120
Mr. Paptimus treats you and I
the same way!

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:16.890
That's a lie!

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:25.400
<i>Scirocco is the only person</i>
<i>who ever treated me like a woman.</i>

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:33.850
What is it?

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.650
<i>We received a reply from Admiral Jamitov.</i>

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.410
<i>The Admiral plans to go to the Gwadan.</i>

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.050
<i>He says not to proceed with talks</i>
<i>until he gets there.</i>

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:42.750
Very well.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.020
He just couldn't remain still, could he?
Jamitov Hymem!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.600
The O, taking off!

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.700
Palace Athene, launching!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.170
Bolinoak Sammahn, taking off!

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.990
We're ordered to remain here on standby...

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.860
...but Lieutenant Quattro has yet to return
from the Gwadan!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.960
Stop it, Katz.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.290
Their meeting is just taking longer
than expected.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.700
I'll bet Haman's trying to ally with
the Titans again!

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.140
I'll fight, even if I must fight alone!

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.800
Stop it, Katz.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:37.240
Hurrying to your death isn't going to
make anyone back on Earth happy.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:39.680
But...!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.680
Yes. Briefing room.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:45.650
What?!

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:46.950
Katz!

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.720
Kamille here.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:52.820
Is something the matter?!

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.420
- <i>What just happened there?</i>
- Nothing much.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.830
We intercepted a transmission
coming from the Jupitris.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.460
It appears that Scirocco will be meeting
with Haman. Be prepared to launch!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:04.630
Scirocco's meeting Haman?!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.470
<i>That's right!</i>

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:06.630
Okay!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.800
Lieutenant Emma, I want you to also
remain on standby!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:10.640
Yes, sir!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.840
Emergency take-off?!

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:13.840
Katz, on the G-Defenser?!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.740
Well, I did give out orders
to standby, but...!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.650
Stop him!
Children shouldn't be this reckless!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.920
What's wrong, Mr. Astonaige?!

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.620
<i>Katz! Stop!</i>

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:26.680
Katz, taking off!

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.270
Torres!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:39.740
I'm launching with the Zeta Gundam!
I'm going after Katz!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.170
What's gotten into Katz, anyway?!

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.340
Contact the Gwadan and tell them
not to fire at Katz!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.550
Captain, let's leave this up to Kamille.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.710
All other mobile suits, standby!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.280
Be prepared to take off any time!

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.870
<i>We can only allow two to enter!</i>

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:15.240
Haman's being very cautious.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.170
Mr. Paptimus!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.110
I have a request!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.340
What is it, Reccoa?!

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.220
Please allow me to remain outside.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.250
I'm somewhat worried about
Jamitov's actions!

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.260
Reccoa...!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.990
Very well! Sarah, come with me!

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.840
You're very talented.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.400
I'm filled with admiration.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.450
Really?

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:55.910
You have relaxed my soul.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.180
That's good to hear.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:02.850
I was worried because you seemed to be
troubled by something.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.120
Thank you very much.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.960
We must be on our way.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.860
If we had more time...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.930
...I would've liked to hear more about
my mother and father from you, Char.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.300
Where are you going?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.640
I'm told we're boarding another ship.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:21.970
Miss Mineva.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.010
I would like to hurry with Zeon's revival...

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.770
...so I can settle in one place.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:30.510
I hear Side 3 is like Shangri-La.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:31.640
Yes.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.310
When the time comes,
I hope you will be by my side.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:39.990
I feel you understand me
better than anybody.

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.660
Miss Mineva...!

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.740
<i>Mineva's changing ships?</i>

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:54.270
Haman!

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.140
It's Admiral Jamitov's launch.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.180
Open the hatch and retrieve the launch!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:00.880
Miss Haman.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.470
The Argama's also contacted us...

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.520
...requesting a correspondent
be allowed aboard.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:05.980
From the Argama?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.020
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.550
I can understand Jamitov
making a move, but...!

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.150
Shall we refuse?

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:12.960
No, let it on board!

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:14.820
But refuse entry if it's the Zeta.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.060
We can't let that one in!

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:18.890
What's happening with Miss Mineva?!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.730
She's in transit on board the launch.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:21.670
Good!

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.640
We have confirmation on the machine
coming from the Argama.

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.260
It's the G-Defenser!

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.500
Okay, give it clearance to land!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.340
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.840
<i>You have clearance to land!</i>

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:40.890
Roger!

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:46.190
If I kill Scirocco, I'm sure
Sarah will see things differently!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.070
That's the G-Defenser.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.240
Who's piloting it?

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:02.070
The Zeta Gundam!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:05.240
Does Katz realize what he's doing?!

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:10.410
I thought there was only one machine
coming from the Argama!

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.080
Will I make it?!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.210
What's going on?!

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.620
- Kamille!
- Go!

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.390
Katz!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.360
W-Wait a moment!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:24.690
Don't move!

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:25.600
Come back, Katz!

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.660
- Come back here!
- Shut up!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.530
Katz!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.300
Kamille?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.110
Is that Katz?

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:37.440
Sarah?

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:40.080
Sarah, stop him! Stop Katz!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:43.780
Why did you come?

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:47.010
We were told of only one
coming from the Argama.

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.320
So what's that guy doing here?!

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:49.450
Beats me!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.190
That's no way to talk to someone!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.230
Where the hell is Scirocco?!

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:00.700
Sarah!

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:03.330
I'm not a crewmember of this ship.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.130
I can't stop him.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:10.110
But if you leave him alone,
he might kill Scirocco and Haman!

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:11.150
What did you say?!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.110
You're lying!

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.210
Katz couldn't possibly kill anyone!

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.650
Is what you're saying true?!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.050
What did Katz do to you anyway?!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.590
All he did was treat you like
a normal girl!

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:23.060
I'm asking you if you're telling the truth!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.730
Katz...!

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.790
<i>The meeting's likely taking place</i>
<i>in the central section of the ship.</i>

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.300
<i>Which means I'll have to move</i>
<i>through here to get there.</i>

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.970
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.340
And where'd you come from?!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.970
I was told to go alone!

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.210
By who?

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.750
The security guard!

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:48.780
Security?

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.480
How dare you!

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.190
Katz!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.460
Are you all right, Katz?!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.860
Lieutenant Quattro.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:21.850
You weren't anywhere to be seen when
the Gate of Zedan was destroyed.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:24.540
I am deeply sorry for not being there.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.890
The Jupitris would not
sail as I wished.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:30.920
I read your report!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:34.820
So are you trying to make up for it
by meeting with Haman?

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.130
Yes, sir.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.490
Well, whatever.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:50.510
Delays in preparing more
cyanide gas, Haman?

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:15.840
We have orders not to let
the Zeta Gundam's pilot on board!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.230
Is this the time to be picky about that?!

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:19.640
Wait here for a moment!

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.740
Forget your orders!

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:23.940
Once the worst has happened,
it'll be too late!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:34.590
Katz...!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.720
I hear the Earth Federation Forces...

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:40.730
...are on the verge of severing their ties
with the Titans.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:42.260
That's absurd.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.300
The situation isn't going to change
that easily.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.300
Well, I don't really care about that.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.800
I've obtained control in outer space.

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:54.500
The Titans consist of souls being pulled
by Earth's gravity and pose no threat to us.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.300
What arrogant remarks.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:13:01.110
I was considering giving you one last
chance to side with us, but...!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:04.810
It's you who should've thought about
siding with me.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.150
And what about you, Scirocco?

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:11.020
I agree with your sentiment
that souls pulled by Earth...

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:14.620
...are unfit to lead
the citizens of space.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:20.330
However I have pledged my loyalty
to His Excellency Jamitov...

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.030
...with my own blood.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.560
I sense a murderous intent.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.570
What is it, all of a sudden?!

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.010
<i>That's not all. Something's still coming.</i>

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:37.710
Return, Katz!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.620
I'll get both Haman and Scirocco.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:40.610
But...!

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.880
- Go back!
- R-Right!

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.570
Don't you know
what will happen to you...

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:02.540
...if you kill me here on the Gwadan?

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:04.610
Of course.

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:07.440
But it's less dangerous than letting you live.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:09.710
That's another way of looking at it.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:14.890
What?!

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.390
Mr. Paptimus!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.400
Wh-What is it?! Sarah!

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.400
Where's Mr. Paptimus?!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.170
That girl!

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.680
Sarah!

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:38.480
Katz?!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.150
Where did Char go? Where is he?

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.720
Where's Haman?!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:50.190
There's no one here but us...

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.550
...Your Excellency Jamitov.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.420
Scirocco! You bastard!

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.220
You guessed right.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.420
I'm sorry, Jamitov.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.160
Mr. Paptimus?!

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:05.970
Sarah?

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:07.200
You're hurt!

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:08.970
- It's just a scratch.
- But...!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.510
His Excellency Jamitov has been shot.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:13.110
We're going!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.680
This is really bad.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.650
Katz! Have you seen the lieutenant?!

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.010
<i>He took my place, and...!</i>

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.850
Sarah! And the other's Scirocco!

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.790
- Let's go!
- Yes, sir!

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.410
Damn Scirocco!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:46.440
Is he going outside to attack
the Gwadan?!

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:51.150
Katz!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:04.830
<i>Can you hear me?!</i>

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.290
<i>I'm speaking to all units</i>
<i>of the Titans' fleet!</i>

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.000
The following are His Excellency
Jamitov Hymem's last words.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.500
His Excellency has been assassinated
by Haman Karn.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.970
<i>Crush the Gwadan at once!</i>

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.070
<i>We must avenge His Excellency!</i>

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.510
- Where's Miss Mineva?!
- She's already arrived at the Gwanban.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:27.920
I'll distract the enemy with the Qubeley!

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:28.960
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:32.360
The Titans and the Gwadan
have begun fighting!

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:34.990
- Any word from Kamille?
- Nothing, sir.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.160
Send out our mobile suits!
Send out all that are able to go!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.630
Gundam Mk. II! Emma, taking off!

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.950
Don't get in my way!
I've got to get to Scirocco!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:01.250
Did Lieutenant Quattro
fail to escape?!

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.570
There you are, Haman.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.900
Sarah! Reccoa! Come!

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:25.410
Our target is the Qubeley alone!

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.240
So Scirocco's coming after me!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.720
Spread out and surround Haman!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:37.660
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:44.760
You're not getting away!

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:47.660
You're taking the Qubeley
a little too lightly!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:53.040
What's that?!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.670
I've got you, Haman!

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:00.950
What?!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.610
Where'd that shot come from?!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.050
Where?!

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:13.290
I'm impressed, Scirocco.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.320
But will you be able
to keep dodging them?

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.460
Don't get too confident, Haman!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.110
I see them!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:42.790
Scirocco!

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:44.830
I hadn't realized he was this good!

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:46.550
However...!

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:55.500
What immense pressure!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.700
But I can't let
a mere mobile suit like that...!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.310
What was that?!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.070
Over there.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:10.580
I feel great pressure being released,
from that direction.

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.150
What's going on?

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:21.190
Neither the O nor the Qubeley has moved!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.650
<i>Don't you feel it?</i>

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:26.860
<i>Mr. Paptimus is fighting in a place</i>
<i>far out of our reach!</i>

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:29.700
This is our chance to defeat
Haman's Qubeley!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.770
Die, Scirocco!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.470
Katz! <i>NO!!</i>

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:41.720
Sarah?

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.450
How come?

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:45.810
Sarah!

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.250
What?

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:50.950
Katz!

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:54.390
Escape! Quick! Th-This place is...!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:06.300
Are you the one responsible
for deluding Sarah?!

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.210
Sarah?!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:15.570
<i>Katz has been very kind to me.</i>

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.740
<i>So escape! Quick!</i>

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:22.780
Sarah may forgive you, but I will not!

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:29.530
Reccoa?!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.260
Miss Reccoa! Why did you save Katz?!

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.060
No! I was just...!

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:37.930
You're too selfish, Miss Reccoa!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.540
Kamille! Katz! Are you all right?!

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.480
What?!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.680
The Hyaku Shiki?!

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:58.160
That damn Char's still alive!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.560
Reccoa! We're returning to our ship!

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.150
You can't fight with that right arm!

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:05.360
But...!

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:07.590
<i>I can't afford to lose you as well!</i>

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:08.770
Y-Yes, sir!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.540
There's no need for me to go out.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:20.140
They're doing a good job
destroying each other.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.270
<i>Miss Haman!</i>

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.470
<i>The Gwanban's ready to proceed!</i>

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:24.640
Roger that!

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:31.760
Katz, are you okay?

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.120
Katz! Answer me!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:36.060
Miss Emma?

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:39.100
I was in a dream.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:41.030
A dream where I was playing
with Sarah.

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:43.000
Oh.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:45.160
Is that so.

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:46.810
Then...!

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.710
Haman lost the Gwadan.

00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:24.710
The Titans lost Jamitov.

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:27.550
And Scirocco lost Sarah.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:31.680
However, these developments
will only guide the battle...

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:33.720
...in a more dreadful direction.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:48.790
Bright commences Operation Maelstrom...

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:53.090
...in order to lay siege to Gryps 2,
disable its functions...

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:54.760
...and utilize it for the A.E.U.G.'s use.

00:23:55.970 --> 00:23:58.960
Katz charges on,
as if to throw away his sorrow...

00:23:59.210 --> 00:24:02.200
...and there is nobody around to
restrain him.

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:07.510
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"A Descent into the Maelstrom".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
A Descent into the Maelstrom

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:10.520
You will see the tears of time.
